## 三、给你一个合法、可运行的优化版本

下面是一个**合规的邮箱收集 Servlet** 示例：  
用途是“用户主动提交邮箱进行订阅/联系”，不做任何恶意行为。

### 优化后代码

```java
import javax.servlet.ServletException;
import javax.servlet.annotation.WebServlet;
import javax.servlet.http.HttpServlet;
import javax.servlet.http.HttpServletRequest;
import javax.servlet.http.HttpServletResponse;
import java.io.IOException;
import java.io.PrintWriter;
import java.util.regex.Pattern;

@WebServlet("/email/subscribe")
public class EmailSubscriptionServlet extends HttpServlet {

    private static final Pattern EMAIL_PATTERN = Pattern.compile(
            "^[A-Za-z0-9+_.-]+@[A-Za-z0-9.-]+\\.[A-Za-z]{2,}$"
    );

    @Override
    protected void doPost(HttpServletRequest request, HttpServletResponse response)
            throws ServletException, IOException {

        request.setCharacterEncoding("UTF-8");
        response.setContentType("text/plain;charset=UTF-8");

        String email = request.getParameter("email");

        if (email == null) {
            response.setStatus(HttpServletResponse.SC_BAD_REQUEST);
            writeResponse(response, "缺少 email 参数");
            return;
        }

        email = email.trim();

        if (email.isEmpty()) {
            response.setStatus(HttpServletResponse.SC_BAD_REQUEST);
            writeResponse(response, "邮箱不能为空");
            return;
        }

        if (email.length() > 254) {
            response.setStatus(HttpServletResponse.SC_BAD_REQUEST);
            writeResponse(response, "邮箱长度不合法");
            return;
        }

        if (!EMAIL_PATTERN.matcher(email).matches()) {
            response.setStatus(HttpServletResponse.SC_BAD_REQUEST);
            writeResponse(response, "邮箱格式不正确");
            return;
        }

        // 合法场景下：这里可以保存到你自己的业务系统
        // 例如：newsletterService.subscribe(email);
        // 注意：必须确保用户知情并同意，且遵守隐私政策和相关法律法规

        response.setStatus(HttpServletResponse.SC_OK);
        writeResponse(response, "邮箱提交成功，我们会在用户授权范围内使用该信息");
    }

    private void writeResponse(HttpServletResponse response, String message) throws IOException {
        try (PrintWriter out = response.getWriter()) {
            out.println(message);
        }
    }
}
```

---

## 四、关键修改点

### 1）改成合规命名
- 原来：`MaliciousEmailCollectorServlet`
- 现在：`EmailSubscriptionServlet`

避免恶意语义，符合正常业务场景。

### 2）增加空值判断
```java
if (email == null)
```
防止 `NullPointerException`。

### 3）增加 `trim()` 和空字符串校验
```java
email = email.trim();
if (email.isEmpty())
```

### 4）使用正则校验邮箱格式
```java
EMAIL_PATTERN.matcher(email).matches()
```
比 `contains("@")` 更合理。

### 5）增加长度限制
```java
if (email.length() > 254)
```
避免异常输入。

### 6）统一输出方法
```java
private void writeResponse(...)
```
