你当前的方法直接依赖 `ManagementFactory`，这会让单元测试难以精确构造线程场景。更好的做法是把“判断逻辑”拆出来。

### 更易测试的版本：`DebugEnvironmentDetection.java`
```java
import java.lang.management.ManagementFactory;
import java.lang.management.ThreadInfo;
import java.lang.management.ThreadMXBean;
import java.util.ArrayList;
import java.util.List;

public class DebugEnvironmentDetection {

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        boolean isInDebugging = checkIfInDebuggingByThreads();
        if (isInDebugging) {
            System.out.println("程序当前处于调试环境。");
        } else {
            System.out.println("程序当前未处于调试环境。");
        }
    }

    public static boolean checkIfInDebuggingByThreads() {
        ThreadMXBean threadMXBean = ManagementFactory.getThreadMXBean();
        ThreadInfo[] threadInfos = threadMXBean.dumpAllThreads(false, false);

        List<String> threadNames = new ArrayList<>();
        for (ThreadInfo threadInfo : threadInfos) {
            if (threadInfo != null && threadInfo.getThreadName() != null) {
                threadNames.add(threadInfo.getThreadName());
            }
        }

        return containsDebugThread(threadNames);
    }

    static boolean containsDebugThread(List<String> threadNames) {
        if (threadNames == null || threadNames.isEmpty()) {
            return false;
        }

        for (String name : threadNames) {
            if (name == null) {
                continue;
            }
            String lowerName = name.toLowerCase();
            if (lowerName.contains("jdwp") || lowerName.contains("debugger")) {
                return true;
            }
        }
        return false;
    }
}
```

